Run these 3 checks

C1: What caused the Oct 6 spike?

fetch dt.davis.problems, from:-7d
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| filter contains(lower(toString(entity_tags)), "portfolio:claims")
| filter event.category == "AVAILABILITY"
| summarize problems = countDistinctExact(display_id),
            apps = countDistinctExact(toString(entity_tags)),
            by:{event.name, dt.davis.impact_level}
| sort problems desc


If most of these are Http monitor global outage with impact Synthetic, the spike is synthetic noise. In that case Tile 1.6 should split Synthetic problems from real application problems, or leave them out.

C2: Claims problems missed by the portfolio filter

fetch dt.davis.problems, from:-7d
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| filter not(contains(lower(toString(entity_tags)), "portfolio:claims"))
| expand tag = entity_tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| lookup [
    fetch dt.entity.host
    | fields id, tags, tagStr = toString(tags)
    | filter contains(lower(tagStr), "portfolio:claims")
    | expand tag = tags
    | filter contains(tag, "APMID:") or contains(tag, "APPID:")
    | fieldsAdd apmid = if(contains(tag, "APMID:"), splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1],
                        else: splitString(tag, "APPID:")[1])
    | filter startsWith(apmid, "APP")
    | summarize hosts = countDistinctExact(id), by:{apmid}
  ], sourceField: apmid, lookupField: apmid, prefix: "c."
| filter isNotNull(c.hosts)
| summarize missed = countDistinctExact(display_id), by:{apmid}
| sort missed desc


If this returns a meaningful number, Tiles 1.4–1.6 should match on Claims APMIDs instead of the portfolio tag. If it returns zero or close to zero, we keep the simpler portfolio filter.

C3: Corrected Tile 1.6 (uses the dashboard time picker, daily bars)

fetch dt.davis.problems
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| filter contains(lower(toString(entity_tags)), "portfolio:claims")
| makeTimeseries problems = count(), by:{event.category}, time:event.start, interval:1d
